{"at": "2026-10-03T02:41:56.806443+00:00", "event_id": "01M3ZT7G26GGP15HMSW22AS35X", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M3ZT7G1XJ2P4KVP6JA8HHEEP", "input_key": "watch_invalid_edit", "mission_id": "01M3ZT6RJENXK1D5FZYETB4V72", "mission_slug": "troupe-config-sync-files-01M3ZT6R", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["Keep watching: report the problem on stderr naming the file, record nothing, reconcile normally once the files load again", "Stop: exit 4 naming the file, like other commands", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "While watch is running, a hand edit leaves the configuration unloadable (YAML syntax error mid-edit, include target missing, include cycle, or both troupe.yml and troupe.yaml present). What should watch do?", "recorded_at": "2026-10-03T02:41:56.806443Z", "run_id": "01M3ZT7G1XJ2P4KVP6JA8HHEEP", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-03T02:41:56.797027Z", "step_id": "specify.watch.invalid-edit"}}
{"at": "2026-10-03T02:42:37.455460+00:00", "event_id": "01M3ZT8QRFPPWQ028ZDRZ5QECZ", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3ZT7G1XJ2P4KVP6JA8HHEEP", "final_answer": "Keep watching: report the problem on stderr naming the file, record nothing, reconcile normally once the files load again. Reason: the contract says watch runs until SIGINT/SIGTERM (exit 0), so exiting 4 mid-run would contradict it; recording nothing while unloadable cannot corrupt history, and reconciling against the last recorded configuration once the files load again loses no edit (TROUPE-002).", "mission_id": "01M3ZT6RJENXK1D5FZYETB4V72", "mission_slug": "troupe-config-sync-files-01M3ZT6R", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-03T02:42:37.455460Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3ZT7G1XJ2P4KVP6JA8HHEEP", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-03T02:42:37.450835Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
