{"at": "2026-10-03T02:45:58.613727+00:00", "event_id": "01M3ZTEW6NJJMMRR5R1NME8PXX", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M3ZTEW6H2NYB4NYVW9RB3PJ3", "input_key": "write_back_suppression", "mission_id": "01M3ZT6RJENXK1D5FZYETB4V72", "mission_slug": "troupe-config-sync-files-01M3ZT6R", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["Theatre lock + compare: every reconcile and every set holds an exclusive lock on .troupe/lock across load, compare, write and record; watch only records what differs from the recorded configuration, so an already-recorded write-back produces nothing", "Fingerprint ignore list: set writes the hashes of files it wrote to a side file; watch skips changes whose bytes match", "Other"], "origin_flow": "plan", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "PLAN", "question": "How is a set's write-back kept from being recorded again by watch, and each hand edit recorded exactly once when watch and a command reconcile at about the same time?", "recorded_at": "2026-10-03T02:45:58.613727Z", "run_id": "01M3ZTEW6H2NYB4NYVW9RB3PJ3", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-03T02:45:58.609043Z", "step_id": "plan.architecture.write-back-suppression"}}
{"at": "2026-10-03T02:46:56.842563+00:00", "event_id": "01M3ZTGN2A9VRVDYWK2951JH3B", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3ZTEW6H2NYB4NYVW9RB3PJ3", "final_answer": "(A) Theatre lock + compare. Every reconcile and every set holds an exclusive flock on <theatre>/.troupe/lock across load, compare, write and record; reconcile records only leaves differing from the recorded configuration. (B) rejected by product owner: it would lose or suppress hand edits.", "mission_id": "01M3ZT6RJENXK1D5FZYETB4V72", "mission_slug": "troupe-config-sync-files-01M3ZT6R", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-03T02:46:56.842563Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3ZTEW6H2NYB4NYVW9RB3PJ3", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-03T02:46:56.837901Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
